    "method": "One image_gen redraw of the overly wide buckle stance, then one knee-flexion and near-hand revision. Replaces frame 3 only. Uniform 0.67 scale, manually measured shoulder/wrist and sole-center landmarks. No whole-body warp or simulated foot constraint. Initial draft exec-f42fc0e7-da36-406b-84df-8f4aaddc9d9e.png was too upright and is not used."
